{%- doc -%}
  Prints "on" while the bundle picker's set offer (theme settings →
  APGO — Bundle Widget → Set offer, e.g. any 3 for RM99) replaces the
  buy-x-get-y tiers, else nothing. Malaysia only: Singapore keeps its
  Single pack + 3+1 (owner, 2026-10-28). Capture it:
  {% capture apgo_set_on %}{% render 'apgo-bundle-set-offer' %}{% endcapture %}

  A cart attribute _apgo_preview_set_offer = 1 turns it on for that cart
  only, so the offer can be checked on the live site before the switch
  (POST /cart/update.js {"attributes": {"_apgo_preview_set_offer": "1"}}).
  Used by snippets/apgo-bundle-widget, sections/apgo-mobile-pdp (subtitle)
  and the cart free-shipping snippets.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if localization.country.iso_code != 'SG' -%}
  {%- if settings.apgo_bundle_set_on or cart.attributes['_apgo_preview_set_offer'] == '1' -%}on{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
